Z||000009||FIEROCIOUS||06-30-2000||12:22 AM||||Ok, took the s10 cover back looked a a bazillion pictures of covers and looked at the crate engine book! There is no part no. for the crate engine cover! Funny but all the other parts have part numbers! So Mike at Young Chevrolet desided to try a 94-95 3.4 engine in the Camaro as it has it's own P/N and doesn't cross referance with the reverse rotation jobbers! I'll find out Wed. <P>Just when you think your going to hit your deadline and race on the 8th and 9th! BWAM you realize you own a Fiero and all hope is gone!  ||||reg||1
