Z||000016||-=shame=-||07-03-2000||08:32 AM||||Man, get it milled, shouldn't run you more that $100, assuming I know exactly the cover you're speaking of. Hell, if you were here I'd do it for $75. Plus, you'll be assured it's flat and true within 0.001. Large surface probably a five hour job. My boss milled valve releifs onto some big V-8 for free for his buddy.<p>[This message has been edited by -=shame=- (edited 07-03-2000).]||||reg||1
